clear whether they will facilitate the imminent construction of new Australian clean energy projects or whether they will pass the penalty price for non-compliance with the Act onto their Australian customers.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-4141","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2016-03-16/2"}
